{"about_the_game":"In <strong>Dreaming Worlds</strong> you play as the red panda Rin and rescue the other Dream Wardens from a mysterious nightmare that has thrown the dream worlds out of balance and turned their inhabitants to stone...or worse!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976110/extras/7ed0a22b32c7dd623150a48137db043d.poster.avif?t=1771777552\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976110/extras/7ed0a22b32c7dd623150a48137db043d.webm?t=1771777552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>In order to do this, you must enter and explore the dream worlds of the other Guardians. There you will be faced with tricky puzzles, you have to overcome gorges and cross deserts.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976110/extras/2e3e8c705fe667bc3c138d5504601499.webp?t=1771777552\" width=600 height=50 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976110/extras/4ece10a1c884d8a141ba90ce892d2025.poster.avif?t=1771777552\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976110/extras/4ece10a1c884d8a141ba90ce892d2025.webm?t=1771777552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>But you are not completely on your own. Although the other Dream Wardens have been mysteriously trapped, you can use some of their special abilities yourself to overcome the obstacles in your journey.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976110/extras/2e3e8c705fe667bc3c138d5504601499.webp?t=1771777552\" width=600 height=50 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976110/extras/08837e2f0303605d7742f295cd0f618d.poster.avif?t=1771777552\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976110/extras/08837e2f0303605d7742f295cd0f618d.webm?t=1771777552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Kitsune the Fox Spirit, Leyfin the Elephant Oracle, and Garv the Panther King await your rescue! The three dream guardians await you in their unique worlds with different challenges and captivating stories.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976110/extras/78d06abbb7927aaf76a165820a254333.webp?t=1771777552\" width=50 height=50 /></span> <strong>This awaits you:</strong><br>\u2666 A third-person game with puzzle &amp; platformer elements<br>\u2666 beautiful and stylized worlds<br>\u2666 backed with an atmospheric soundtrack<br>\u2666 various magical stories","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1976110?t=1771777552","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1976110?t=1771777552","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976110/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771777552","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976110/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771777552","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"In <strong>Dreaming Worlds</strong> you play as the red panda Rin and rescue the other